{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1525695-wtf-2e-blessed-pack-homebrew-perks","id":1525695,"title":"WtF 2E - Blessed Pack homebrew perks???","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-11-20T13:23:34-08:00","id":1525695,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon5.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> WtF 2E - Blessed Pack homebrew perks???","content":"By definition, a Forsaken pack with all 5 Auspices, which was not really explored in WtF 1E sadly. It was described as a rare and special thing so what kind of worthwhile perks could be created for WtF 2E?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11532,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11532-dpowell","user":"DPowell","date":". 11-20-2023, 09:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11532-dpowell","name":"DPowell","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11532_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":1,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-11-20T14:22:06-08:00","id":1525698,"title":"","content":"Is there a need for even more perks? Auspices have some of the few powers/perks in Forsaken that are exclusive and can't be bought by other means. Having all five Hunter Aspects, and all five Moon Gift Lists, and a bunch of Auspice specific Merits, all in one pack? That's already a big boon for such a pack.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-11-20T14:36:00-08:00","id":1525699,"title":"","content":"I feel most of the perks will be narrative; the perceived right to lord over other packs, favors of the Lunes, a unique Rite or two, etc. Maybe there\u2019s something to add on territory-building or pack-shared Merits?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-11-20T15:06:06-08:00","id":1525700,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12619_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12619\" data-vbnamecard=\"12619\">21C Hermit</a> Ooh, great ideas! Outside of the obvious benefits, elements that really speak to how special a blessed pack is and some light game mechanics, would make for a great/unique experience for players, I think. It should really mean something.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11532,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11532-dpowell","user":"DPowell","date":". 11-20-2023, 06:15 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11532-dpowell","name":"DPowell","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11532_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":1,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-11-20T15:07:44-08:00","id":1525701,"title":"","content":"A pack with all 5 auspices will also be exceptionally well rounded with at least 1 person able to fulfill virtually any role, theoretically at least. Going to the shadow? Got the Ithaeur. Going to fight? Got the Rahu. Going to hunt? Got the Irraka. Etc.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27618-shadowcatx","name":"ShadowcatX","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27618_2.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-11-20T16:55:17-08:00","id":1525703,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DPowell</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1525695-wtf-2e-blessed-pack-homebrew-perks#post1525695\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">By definition, a Forsaken pack with all 5 Auspices, which was not explored in WtF 1E sadly. It was described as a rare and special thing so what kind of worthwhile perks could be created for WtF 2E?</div> </div> </div> </div>The only place that explored the blessings on 1ed, is <b>War Against the Pure</b>:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong> &quot;War Against the Pure p.149&quot;</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Blessed Packs</b><br /> In a crusade chronicle, blessed packs, those<br /> that contain one member from each auspice, gain<br /> even more status and power. When acting within<br /> sight of one another, the members of a Blessed<br /> Pack gain +1 to all Harmony and control rolls<br /> (Resolve + Composure), but only if all members<br /> of the pack join the crusade.<br /> <b>Twice-Blessed Packs:</b> Packs that contain all<br /> five auspices and all five tribal associations are<br /> Twice-Blessed, gaining the benefits above and + 1<br /> to their Tribal Primary Renown.<br /> If these packs lose a member and no longer<br /> qualify as blessed, they lose the associated<br /> benefits, though they can be regained when<br /> they again meet the requirements\u200b</div> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}